WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Break-even model. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Find where revenue meets total cost

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Break-even occurs where modeled revenue equals modeled total cost. It depends on price, volume and cost assumptions.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: With $500 fixed cost and $10 contribution per unit, break-even is 50 units in this simplified example.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Graph interpretation

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Teaching relationships only—not live quotes, prices, tax advice or forecasts.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Find where revenue meets total cost
